      "text": "What value does Hirsch Gillivan offer Founders w/ its acquisitions?\n\nMost acquirers buy your business and disappear.\n\nWe do the opposite.\n\nWhen Hirsch Gillivan acquires a company, here's what comes with the check:\n\n1. Profitability Obsession\n\n- We dig into your P&L line by line\n- Cut what doesn't drive revenue or retention\n- Reinvest savings into growth channels that compound\n- Most businesses leave 20-30% margin on the table. We find it.\n\n2. Global Talent on Day 1\n\n- 15+ years hiring from the Philippines, India, Pakistan, US\n- VAs, specialists, operators, CEOs...we know where to find each\n- A foolproof interview process that filters for skills + values + culture fit\n- Your payroll drops. Your output goes up.\n\n3. A Marketing & Growth Machine\n\n- SEO content systems that drive BOFU traffic\n- Personal brand strategy on LinkedIn + X (we have 200,000+ followers to prove it)\n- Email marketing automation, partner networks, sponsorships\n- Proven playbooks we've run across 10+ companies\n\n4. Founder Insights From the Trenches\n\n- We've started, scaled, sold ($25M sales on Amazon, $12M ARR FreeUp exit)\n- We've hired 100s of people across continents\n- We've built remote cultures that retain top talent for years\n- You don't get a board seat from us. You get operators who've been there.\n\n5. A Real Partnership\n\n- We're not flipping you in 3 years\n- We hold for the long term. 10+ year mindset\n- You stay involved at the level you want\n- Your team becomes part of a portfolio w/ shared resources\n\n---\n\nMost PE firms buy companies, strip them, and run.\n\nWe buy companies to grow them, profit with them, and build a portfolio that lasts decades.\n\nIf you're a founder with a profitable B2B business and you're thinking about your next chapter, let's talk.\n\nWe're different. And founders who've worked with us will tell you that.\n\n---\n\nWhat you think? Good value add?\n\nRepost if you know a founder considering an exit...this might change how they think about it.\n\nP.S. Hirsch Gillivan is actively acquiring profitable B2B businesses. DM me and let's start a conversation.",
